WEBVTT

00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:31.621
the Zig-Zag Project six episodes to
get you from stuck to inspired.

00:01:32.038 --> 00:01:35.496
Every two weeks, you'll learn about
an issue in work and business,

00:01:35.871 --> 00:01:39.746
an idea about how to make it better
with stories from listeners.

00:01:40.204 --> 00:01:43.829
And Innosight, from the folks who
inspired me to come up with

00:01:43.829 --> 00:01:45.371
an assignment for you to do

00:01:46.621 --> 00:01:49.788
the assignments might remind you of
ones you've done in the past.

00:01:50.329 --> 00:01:52.413
Maybe you've done career
workshops or something,

00:01:52.829 --> 00:01:55.204
or it might be completely new to you.

00:01:55.538 --> 00:01:57.663
But I do hope you'll join us because

00:01:57.663 --> 00:02:02.496
I have run interactive projects with
thousands of listeners before.